    <string name="discord_step3_content">Gusa Hali yako (chini ya jina la mtumiaji) na uchague Mtandaoni, Hakuna kitu au Usisumbue. ⚠️ Usitumie Isionekane — Discord huficha shughuli ya Kizzy unapokuwa Usionekane.</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_title">Kabla ya kuanza</string>
    <string name="console_auto_detect">Utambue kiotomatiki DroidDeck / Eden</string>
    <string name="console_detected_hint">Gusa ili kutumia mchezo huu kwa Console RPC</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_content">Tafuta "Shiriki shughuli yangu" na uiwashe. Chini ya "Mahali Ninashiriki Shughuli", chagua "Shiriki kwenye serveri zote". Sogeza hadi "Ma Serveri Yangu" na uwashe serveri unazotaka hali yako ionekane.</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_content">Baadhi ya toleo za simu za Discord huficha kiungo hiki. Fungua discord.com kwenye Chrome → washa tovuti ya Desktop → ingia → Mipangilio (⚙️) → Faragha ya Shughuli → washa "Shiriki shughuli yangu".</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_desc">Uhakikishe kuwa Discord inaruhusu shughuli yako kuonyeshwa kwenye wasifu wako.</string>
    <string name="auto_detect_activity_type_desc">Programu za muziki hutambuliwa kama muziki na programu za video kama video, hivyo YouTube Music haionekani tena kama mchezo. Aina iliyochaguliwa kwa programu moja hushikilia kila wakati.</string>
